  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "欢迎光临会为您提供\n最佳服务的秀丽世。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B228FCE51494E344F1A4E3A60A863D04F9B000A67004F73670D52A1768479C04E3D4E1630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由紫小姐的想法是\n“为了和宝可梦度过最佳的时光，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有能力的人就该尽到责任”，对吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75317D2B5C0F59D0768460F36CD5662F000A201C4E3A4E86548C5B9D53EF68A65EA68FC767004F73768465F65149FF0C00100001BE00000A670980FD529B76844EBA5C318BE55C3D52308D234EFB201DFF0C5BF95427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为她的梦想是\n把密阿雷市打造成<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n对人和宝可梦来说\n都是最棒的城市啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A5979768468A660F3662F000A628A5BC6963F96F75E0262539020621000100001BE01000A5BF94EBA548C5B9D53EF68A667658BF4000A90FD662F670068D2768457CE5E02554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由紫小姐跟MSBC\n会照亮密阿雷的未来。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75317D2B5C0F59D08DDF004D005300420043000A4F1A71674EAE5BC6963F96F77684672A676530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多亏了礼宾部的榴红，\n我感觉非常舒适。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A4E8F4E86793C5BBE90E8768469B47EA2FF0C000A6211611F89C9975E5E388212900230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在用礼宾部提供的行程\n尽情地游览密阿雷。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B6357287528793C5BBE90E863D04F9B7684884C7A0B000A5C3D60C557306E3889C85BC6963F96F730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然游览的行程也很棒，\n但我想要打宝可梦对战啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71366E3889C87684884C7A0B4E5F5F8868D2FF0C000A4F46621160F3898162535B9D53EF68A65BF96218554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "酒店里不但有\n宝可梦的美容沙龙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91525E9791CC4E0D4F466709000A5B9D53EF68A676847F8E5BB96C999F99202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用来锻炼宝可梦的\n训练房也是超棒的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75286765953B70BC5B9D53EF68A67684000A8BAD7EC3623F4E5F662F8D8568D2768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果想过极简生活，\n可以选择长期住在旅馆。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60F38FC767817B80751F6D3BFF0C000A53EF4EE5900962E9957F671F4F4F572865C5998630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欢迎光临\n秀丽世大酒店。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B228FCE51494E34000A79C04E3D4E16592791525E9730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "欢迎光临\n秀丽世大酒店。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B228FCE51494E34000A79C04E3D4E16592791525E9730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我好想吃遍\n这里的餐厅啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211597D60F35403904D000A8FD991CC768499105385554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "机会难得，真希望\n能在密阿雷捉到宝可梦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "673A4F1A96BE5F97FF0C771F5E0C671B000A80FD57285BC6963F96F7634952305B9D53EF68A630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果想要实现大家的愿望，\n我们的入住天数可不够啊……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C60F389815B9E73B059275BB67684613F671BFF0C000A62114EEC768451654F4F5929657053EF4E0D591F554A202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我朋友要我帮忙\n代购这代购那的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670B53CB898162115E2E5FD9000A4EE38D2D8FD94EE38D2D90A3768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们偷偷混进\nMSBC的派对里吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC507750776DF78FDB000A004D00530042004376846D3E5BF991CC542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是被捉到了，\n可会被可怕的姐姐骂哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F88AB634952304E86FF0C000A53EF4F1A88AB53EF6015768459D059D09A8254E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你计划好怎样培育\n接下来想选为主力的宝可梦了吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608BA15212597D600E683757F980B2000A63A54E0B676560F390094E3A4E3B529B76845B9D53EF68A64E865417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我还在烦恼啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n是该让它均衡地学习招式，\n还是彻底加强某个属性呢？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118FD8572870E6607C554A300200100001BE01000A662F8BE58BA95B835747886157305B664E6062DB5F0FFF0C000A8FD8662F5F7B5E9552A05F3A67D04E2A5C5E60275462FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "菜总是做得很棒！\n记得替我谢谢大厨哦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83DC603B662F505A5F975F8868D2FF01000A8BB05F9766FF62118C228C22592753A854E630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为本酒店的大厨\n是志米先生的高徒。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A672C91525E977684592753A8000A662F5FD77C735148751F76849AD85F9230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    }
  ],
